  "caption": "Mary Anderson invented the windshield wiper in 1903\n\nSnow fell on a New York streetcar, and the driver kept stopping to wipe the glass by hand.\n\nShe won US patent 743801 on November 10, 1903. Car makers said no, the patent expired in 1920, and Cadillac made wipers standard in 1922.\n\nSend this to whoever drives in the rain.\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mary_Anderson_(inventor)",
